Android installs come from GitHub releases, which tell no one about a new version: a daily check raises one launch sheet per new release and a Settings row while the app is out of date, with a toggle to turn it off (Android/Update/AppUpdateCheck+Android.swift, Android/Views/AppUpdate+Android.swift). Applies after 0017, whose Settings lines it extends.

